            {
                "entry_id": "f0d58a40-5b40-365e-9c81-6339102a1966",
                "word": "clime",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "72f59f10-72dd-423f-9df1-878304ce300e",
                        "entry_id": "f0d58a40-5b40-365e-9c81-6339102a1966",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "climes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                        "entry_id": "f0d58a40-5b40-365e-9c81-6339102a1966",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A particular region defined by its weather or climate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d2407c7-8f58-4063-a281-70a2a0f6280e",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "After working hard all of his life, Max retired to warmer climes in Florida."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac1c6e6d-6c31-4939-8272-7f1c8608941b",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "Is this the Region, this the Soil, the Clime,\nSaid then the lost Arch-Angel, this the seat\nThat we must change for Heav'n, this mournful gloom\nFor that celestial light?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5530fd95-2313-4648-9ab4-a930762c5157",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "My ſoul turn from them, turn we to ſurvey / Where rougher climes a nobler race diſplay,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61698f85-a1ab-4588-b482-6335de07ffc3",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "\"And as their valour, so you trow, defied\non aspe'rous voyage cruel harm and sore,\nso many changing skies their manhood tried,\nsuch climes where storm-winds blow and billows roar[.]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b76e17ac-6249-4af8-824b-1517efaee4ed",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "She thought of her husband in some vague warm clime on the other side of the globe, while she was here in the cold."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38734ea7-836e-4967-9b3d-b5f177c424cf",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "She had not yielded for an instant to the enervating charm of the tropics, but contrariwise was more active, more worldly, more decided than anyone in a temperate clime would have thought it possible to be."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f50f30ca-a0ba-4008-bee2-84530eff9ca6",
                                "sense_id": "62cefbb0-a584-39b7-a82f-6a1e0e592f5d",
                                "text": "As heat and wildfires plague many parts of Europe, the desire for cooler climes is driving tourists to Nordic countries, prompting as much concern as celebration. […] The word is “coolcation,” and in an industry that has never met a trend it couldn’t slap a portmanteau onto, the term refers to the growing number of travelers who are avoiding the heat of traditional summer spots in favor of chillier climes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fc48485a-2a7b-3488-b8d8-1689e7b8cb49",
                        "entry_id": "f0d58a40-5b40-365e-9c81-6339102a1966",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Climate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca40520a-c3d7-45e9-adac-8dc80ea6953e",
                                "sense_id": "fc48485a-2a7b-3488-b8d8-1689e7b8cb49",
                                "text": "A change of clime was exactly what the family needed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7ba16e6-616c-3f4b-9e41-abfe6e341910",
                        "entry_id": "f0d58a40-5b40-365e-9c81-6339102a1966",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The context in general of a particular political, moral, etc., situation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "figuratively",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6a1fb75-f39f-4228-bbcd-d8ba5fa0e3ae",
                                "sense_id": "a7ba16e6-616c-3f4b-9e41-abfe6e341910",
                                "text": "It is a poor state of affairs this great nation is in at present. The current political clime is pregnant with attempts and desired to make lawful such discriminatory acts based on factors within an individual's constitution which are beyond her/his control."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
